# ordered comparisons, also of negative values, which compare the other
# way round as integers
itof 1 as one
itof 2 as two
itof -1 as m1
itof -2 as m2
flt one two as a
flt two one as b
flt m2 m1 as c
flt m1 m2 as d
fle one one as e
fle two one as f
feq one one as g
feq one two as h
shl b 1 as b
shl c 2 as c
shl d 3 as d
shl e 4 as e
shl f 5 as f
shl g 6 as g
shl h 7 as h
or a b as a
or a c as a
or a d as a
or a e as a
or a f as a
or a g as a
or a h as a
rt exit a
